{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "WEBSTER1833",
  "book_code": "1CH",
  "chapter": 16,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "1CH.16.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.16.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "So they brought the ark of God, and set it in the midst of the tent that David had pitched for it: and they offered burnt-sacrifices and peace-offerings before God.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.16.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.16.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And when David had made an end of offering the burnt-offerings and the peace-offerings, he blessed the people in the name of the LORD.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.16.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.16.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And he dealt to every one of Israel, both man and woman, to every one a loaf of bread, and a good piece of flesh, and a flagon ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "of wine",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.16.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.16.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And he appointed ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "certain",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " of the Levites to minister before the ark of the LORD, and to record, and to thank and praise the LORD God of Israel:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.16.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.16.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Asaph the chief, and next to him Zechariah, Jeiel, and Shemiramoth, and Jehiel, and Mattithiah, and Eliab, and Benaiah, and Obed-edom: and Jeiel with psalteries and with harps; but Asaph made a sound with cymbals;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.16.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.16.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Benaiah also and Jahaziel the priests with trumpets continually before the ark of the covenant of God.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.16.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.16.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Then on that day David delivered first ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "this psalm",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " to thank the LORD into the hand of Asaph and his brethren.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.16.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.16.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Give thanks to the LORD, call upon his name, make known his deeds among the people.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.16.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.16.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Sing to him, sing psalms to him, talk ye of all his wonderous works.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.16.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.16.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Glory ye in his holy name: let the heart of them rejoice that seek the LORD.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.16.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.16.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Seek the LORD and his strength, seek his face continually.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.16.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.16.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Remember his wonderful works that he hath done, his wonders, and the judgments of his mouth;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.16.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.16.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "O ye seed of Israel his servant, ye children of Jacob, his chosen ones.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.16.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.16.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the LORD our God; his judgments ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " in all the earth.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.16.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.16.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Be ye mindful always of his covenant; the word ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "which",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " he commanded to a thousand generations;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.16.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.16.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Even of the covenant",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " which he made with Abraham, and of his oath to Isaac;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.16.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.16.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And which he confirmed to Jacob for a law, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " to Israel ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "for",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " an everlasting covenant,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.16.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.16.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Saying, To thee will I give the land of Canaan, the lot of your inheritance;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.16.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.16.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "When ye were but few, even a few, and strangers in it.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.16.20",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.16.20",
      "verse": 20,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "when",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " they went from nation to nation, and from ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "one",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " kingdom to another people;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.16.21",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.16.21",
      "verse": 21,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He suffered no man to do them wrong: yea, he reproved kings for their sakes,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.16.22",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.16.22",
      "verse": 22,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Saying",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ", Touch not my anointed, and do my prophets no harm.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.16.23",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.16.23",
      "verse": 23,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Sing to the LORD, all the earth; show forth from day to day his salvation.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.16.24",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.16.24",
      "verse": 24,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Declare his glory among the heathen; his wonderful works among all nations.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.16.25",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.16.25",
      "verse": 25,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For great ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the LORD, and greatly to be praised: he also ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " to be feared above all gods.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.16.26",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.16.26",
      "verse": 26,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For all the gods of the people ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " idols: but the LORD made the heavens.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.16.27",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.16.27",
      "verse": 27,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Glory and honor ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " in his presence; strength and gladness ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " in his place.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.16.28",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.16.28",
      "verse": 28,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Give to the LORD, ye kindreds of the people, give to the LORD glory and strength.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.16.29",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.16.29",
      "verse": 29,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Give to the LORD the glory ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "due",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " to his name: bring an offering, and come before him: worship the LORD in the beauty of holiness.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.16.30",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.16.30",
      "verse": 30,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Fear before him, all the earth: the world also shall be stable, that it be not moved.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.16.31",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.16.31",
      "verse": 31,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Let the heavens be glad, and let the earth rejoice: and let ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "men",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " say among the nations, The LORD reigneth.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.16.32",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.16.32",
      "verse": 32,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Let the sea roar, and the fullness thereof: let the fields rejoice, and all that ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " therein.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.16.33",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.16.33",
      "verse": 33,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Then shall the trees of the wood sing at the presence of the LORD, because he cometh to judge the earth.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.16.34",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.16.34",
      "verse": 34,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "O give thanks to the LORD; for ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "he is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " good; for his mercy ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "endureth",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " for ever.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.16.35",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.16.35",
      "verse": 35,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And say ye, Save us, O God of our salvation, and gather us together, and deliver us from the heathen, that we may give thanks to thy holy name, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " glory in thy praise.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.16.36",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.16.36",
      "verse": 36,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Blessed ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "be",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the LORD God of Israel for ever and ever. And all the people said, Amen, and praised the LORD.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.16.37",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.16.37",
      "verse": 37,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "So he left there before the ark of the covenant of the LORD Asaph and his brethren, to minister before the ark continually, as every day's work required:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.16.38",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.16.38",
      "verse": 38,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Obed-edom with their brethren, sixty and eight; Obed-edom also the son of Jeduthun and Hosah ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "to be",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " porters:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.16.39",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.16.39",
      "verse": 39,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Zadok the priest, and his brethren the priests, before the tabernacle of the LORD in the high place that ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " at Gibeon,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.16.40",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.16.40",
      "verse": 40,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "To offer burnt-offerings to the LORD upon the altar of the burnt-offering continually morning and evening, and ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "to do",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " according to all that is written in the law of the LORD, which he commanded Israel;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.16.41",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.16.41",
      "verse": 41,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And with them Heman and Jeduthun, and the rest that were chosen, who were expressed by name, to give thanks to the LORD, because his mercy ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "endureth",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " for ever;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.16.42",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.16.42",
      "verse": 42,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And with them Heman and Jeduthun with trumpets and cymbals for those that should make a sound, and with musical instruments of God. And the sons of Jeduthun ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "were",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " porters.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.16.43",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.16.43",
      "verse": 43,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And all the people departed every man to his house: and David returned to bless his house.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    }
  ]
}
